Wu's Fighting Cap	25	{"kind":"recipe","title":"Wu's Fighting Cap","wikiPath":"/Wu's_Fighting_Cap","sources":[{"kind":"recipe","where":"Player crafted"}],"components":[{"name":"Cap Pattern","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Cap_Pattern"},{"name":"Cap Pattern","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Cap_Pattern"},{"name":"Heady Kiola","qty":4,"wikiPath":"/Heady_Kiola"},{"name":"Silk Swatch","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Silk_Swatch"},{"name":"Vial of Viscous Mana","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Vial_of_Viscous_Mana"}],"rewards":[],"card":{"title":"Wu's Fighting Cap","icon":"https://eqlwiki.com/images/a/a4/Item_640.png","lines":["MAGIC ITEM","Slot: HEAD","AC: 5","AGI: +3","WT: 0.1 Size: SMALL","Class: MNK","Race: ALL"]},"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:03:10.354Z","outOfEra":false}
Air Tight Box Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Air Tight Box Quest","wikiPath":"/Air_Tight_Box_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Ak'Anon","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Larkon Theardor","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Infected Rat Livers","qty":10,"wikiPath":"/Infected_Rat_Livers"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Coin, Faction"}],"card":{"title":"Air Tight Box Quest","lines":["Recommended Level: 3","Classes: All","Related Zones: Steamfont Mountains","Related NPCs: Fodin Frugrin, an infected rat","Faction note: At Apprehensive faction"]},"links":["Ak'Anon","Larkon Theardor","Steamfont Mountains","Fodin Frugrin","An infected rat","Faction","Air Tight Box","Infected Rat Livers","Eldritch Collective","Gem Choppers","King AkAnon","Dark Reflection","The Dead","Basilisk Tongues","Minotaur Horns"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Larkon Theardor","text":"Greetings! Welcome to the Library of Mechanimagica. You must be a [current member of the Library] or has my [mind begun to slip]?"},{"npc":"Larkon Theardor","text":"What!!? That was but a joke. I try to make you feel comfortable with a little levity and you proclaim my mind has gone the way of Meldrath's. Well.. enough frivolity. You will do your part to help in the menial tasks of the Collective. Do you want the [clean tasks] or the [dirty tasks]?"},{"npc":"Larkon Theardor","text":"Clean... Dirty... It matters not. You have upset me with your rude remarks. You will go to the Steamfont Mountains. There you will find Fodin and tell him I have sent you. He will have a nice tidy task for you. A bath! Be on your way!"},{"npc":"Fodin Frugrin","text":"Hello ______. Have you ever peered beyond our little world? Somewhere out there in the vast darkness is a world filled with great technology and adventure. Our people should concentrate on reaching these distant worlds beyond the sparkling skies."},{"npc":"Fodin Frugrin","text":"There is much you must do for the Library of Machanimagica before such things can be revealed to you. Perhaps fetching minotaur horns and returning them to Professor Theardor will earn you membership to the Library of Machanimagica. But I suppose if Larkon sent you that you truly wish to prove yourself, eh? You'll have to get your hands a bit dirty, though. Take this box and fill it with livers from those infected rats. We need them for research. Well go on. You can take a bath when you're done."},{"npc":"Fodin Frugrin","text":"So they found another young member to attend to their putrid hunt, eh? Take this box. You will notice that your box has ten slots and does not smell very good. That is because each slot must be filled with the diseased livers of infected rats. Hop to it, then! Go get some diseased livers. And if you should get bitten and find yourself diseased or poisoned, be sure to visit the Abbey of Deep Musing. They have healers who can cure disease. Do not forget to return the box to Larkon."},{"npc":"Larkon Theardor","text":"Whew!! What smells of rotting disease? Oh.. It's you. I see you've gathered all the diseased livers. I shall have them incinerated in the scrapyard. The only reason we do this is to keep the Dark Reflection from using these components in their black arts. Take this. I hope you use it wisely. Oh, and.. take a bath. You stink!!"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:03:11.437Z","outOfEra":false}
Parrying Pick Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Parrying Pick Quest","wikiPath":"/Parrying_Pick_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"North Kaladim","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Diggins","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Crytil's Tongue","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Crytil%27s_Tongue"},{"name":"Keldyn's Tongue","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Keldyn%27s_Tongue"},{"name":"Barma's Tongue","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Barma%27s_Tongue"},{"name":"Rondo's Tongue","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Rondo%27s_Tongue"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Parrying Pick 628","item":"Parrying Pick 628","wikiPath":"/Parrying_Pick_628"}],"card":{"title":"Parrying Pick Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 13","Classes: Rogue","Related Zones: Butcherblock Mountains, Crushbone","Related NPCs: Barma Dunfire, Crytil Dunfire, Keldyn Dunfire, Rondo Dunfire"]},"links":["Kaladim","Diggins","Rogue","Butcherblock Mountains","Crushbone","Barma Dunfire","Crytil Dunfire","Keldyn Dunfire","Rondo Dunfire","Parrying Pick 628","Runnyeye Warbeads (Kaladim Rogue)","Butcherblock Bandits","Miners Guild 628","Storm Guard","Crytil's Tongue","Keldyn's Tongue","Barma's Tongue","Slave Keys","Brass Earring","Rondo's Tongue","Circle Of Unseen Hands","DeepPockets","Hall of the Ebon Mask","Miners Pick","Mater"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Diggins","text":"Seek Mater and tell him you are ready."},{"npc":"Diggins","text":"Well done. Butcherblock is a better place with those blagards out of the way. Go see Mater, he has a job for you and tell him [you are ready] to earn your Mining Pick 628"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:03:14.694Z","outOfEra":false}
