:"Friend of the Tunarean Court","lines":["Minimum Level: 50","Classes: Ranger, Druid","Related Zones: Various","Related NPCs: Various"]},"links":["The Wakening Land","Shamus Aghllsews","Ranger","Druid","Tunarean Signet Ring","Kromrif Laborer Pick","Tunarean Court","Empty Crest Case","Countess Silveana","Lord Gossimerwind","Lord Prismwing","Crest of the Wood Nymphs Quest","Eysa Florawhisper","Wakening Land","Wakening Lands","Empty Seed Collection Bag","Misty Acorn","Misty Thicket","Emerald Orange","Emerald Jungle","Bag of Caynar Nuts","Toxxulia Forest","Vineclinger Berries","Butcherblock Mountains","Ripened Heartfruit","Greater Faydark","Rathe Berries","Lake Rathe","Marr Cherries","Ocean of Tears","Flarefire Seeds","Field of Bone","Bag of Seeds","Crest of the Unicorn Quest","Lithiniath (Black Version)","Plane of Mischief","A white stallion","Crest of the Sifaye Quest","A storm giant surveyor","Kromzek Surveyor Scope","Crest of the Fauns Quest","A storm giant architect","Kromzek Architect Blueprints","Bag of Crushed Herbs","Crystallized Sulfur","Bag of Sulfur","Kael","Pile of Rubble","Crest of the Drixie Quest","Yvolcarn","Cobalt Scar","Drixie Remains","Crest of the Faerie Dragons Quest","A Storm Giant Foreman","Kromzek Foreman Helm"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Shamus Aghllsews","text":"Welcome to my fiefdom wayward Gnome. I am Duke Shamus Aghllsews of the Tunarean Court. Only those who pledge friendship or membership to the Court are allowed sanctuary in the Wakening Lands."},{"npc":"Shamus Aghllsews","text":"You must first prove your intentions to the Tunarean Court. I will permit you to participate in an oath of friendship only after you bring me four picks used by the Kromrif Laborers that are attempting to build into our lands."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:03:15.785Z","outOfEra":true}
Wino	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Wino","wikiPath":"/Wino","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Kelethin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"a drunkard","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Elven Wine","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Elven_Wine"}],"rewards":[],"card":{"title":"Wino","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: None","Related NPCs: None"]},"links":["Greater Faydark","A drunkard","Elven Wine","Bandit Sisters"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"a drunkard","text":"Please... Can anyone spare some coppers? <Hic>... Anyone?"},{"npc":"a drunkard","text":"Can you spare some copper or silver? I just.. <Hic>.. need some change to buy something to drin.. er.. eat. <Hic>.."},{"npc":"a drunkard","text":"Oh.. .. Thank you!! Oh, what has become of me?! Look at me!! I was great once. I wish I never had that shocking experience."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:03:16.869Z","outOfEra":false}
Note for Rebby	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Note for Rebby","wikiPath":"/Note_for_Rebby","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"East Freeport","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Nestral TGaza","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Faction","item":"Faction","wikiPath":"/Faction"},{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Coin"}],"card":{"title":"Note for Rebby","lines":["Minimum Level: 1+","Classes: All (Mainly for Evil/Neutral Classes)","Related Zones: West Freeport","Related NPCs: Rebby Willend","Faction note: Hand in: Message to Rebby. This turn-in requires a certain faction level. (Reportedly completable with dubious faction)"]},"links":["Freeport","Nestral TGaza","Rebby Willend","Faction","East Freeport#East Freeport Tunnels","Dismal Rage","Message to Rebby","West Freeport","Rebby's Rat Whiskers","Coalition of Tradefolk Underground","Coalition of Tradefolk","Carson McCabe","Corrupt Qeynos Guards","The Freeport Militia","Note for Janam"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Nestral TGaza","text":"Hey, hello there, _____. It's been so busy around here lately! Barely time to eat and sleep, let alone have any fun. Oh well, it keeps me employed. But, I really could use someone to [help] me out around here."},{"npc":"Nestral TGaza","text":"Yeah, if you can help me out with a few things that'd be great! Geez, where do we start? I need someone to run over to [Janam and Rebby's]? Can you do that for me?"},{"npc":"Nestral TGaza","text":"Janam and Rebby are a couple of merchants working the area around the entrance to Arcstone over in West Freeport. It's part of my job to keep tabs on those two rascals. I need someone to take this note to Rebby for me. Don't worry, your efforts won't go unnoticed, _____."},{"npc":"Nestral TGaza","text":"Thank you _____, You have done well."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:03:17.960Z","outOfEra":false}
